30,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Transport is a massive cost variable, and it's worrying that a fifth of members don't even show up to away camps.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Public bookings are a bureaucratic nightmare, and cooking for ourselves is a huge time sink for the staff.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minako,,The seniors are right; bonding only happens during the evenings when everyone stays together. But attendance is a real issue.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Public beds are cheap, but other clubs reported crowded rooms and strict lights-out, which ruins sleep.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Whole-building lets are risky because non-refundable deposits mean the rest of us pay for those who drop out.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if transport is that expensive and people cancel, staying local seems like the only safe financial move.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, I agree. Avoiding the lottery and the cooking duties would save the organizers from burnout.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, but if we stay local, we lose those evenings. We can't fix the year-group divide if people just go home.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I'd rather have a quiet night than a crowded dorm where no one sleeps. The inland centers sound exhausting.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the transport receipts confirm that staying local drastically reduces the total cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I can't support any plan where we risk a deficit because of non-refundable deposits or low attendance.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The administrative burden of a public center is simply too high for a small organizing team.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minako,,"If we don't prioritize the social health of the club, the camp is just a training session, not a camp.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm leaning away from anything that involves shared dorms with eight people to a room.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We need a system that doesn't penalize the members who actually show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
