55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Campus Intensive is the only option that guarantees we won't overspend on transport or deposits.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I vote Campus Intensive. It eliminates the booking lottery and the cooking duties entirely.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minako,,"I can't vote for Campus. If people go home, the year-groups will never mix. I prefer the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The Coastal Lodge sounds best for sleep and recovery, provided we can afford it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The Lodge is too risky financially due to the headcount deposits. I vote Campus Intensive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minako, the attendance sheets show people don't always come. Why risk a huge deposit on a Lodge?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, the Lodge is better for sleep, but the workload for the organizers is still higher than Campus.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, that's exactly why we need a place that encourages them to stay! The Lodge is a fresh start.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, I understand the workload, but the quality of the training depends on the quality of the rest.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the financial risk of the Lodge is a burden on the club account, which we can't afford.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm sticking with Campus Intensive. It's the most responsible choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Campus is the most efficient.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minako,,I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge. Social cohesion is worth the risk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll also vote for the Coastal Lodge. Sleep is non-negotiable for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Campus Intensive is the only logical choice for the budget.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
